  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: StringsTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bbc577575d755f2468f29145e420373b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 4016942959552888834
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2611756699648
    m_Localized: Hello there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2678290944000
    m_Localized: Why don't you deliver that tablet to Castle Nick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 646613359169536
    m_Localized: To Castle Nick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1733489973301248
    m_Localized: '{distance:roman()} ft'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4016942959552888834
  - m_Id: 1737285973610496
    m_Localized: Locomotion Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1740139677388800
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1740364324311040
    m_Localized: Vignette
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1740549708353536
    m_Localized: Strength
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1740986754830336
    m_Localized: Settings may cause motion sickness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1743823022886912
    m_Localized: Teleport
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1743868182958080
    m_Localized: Smooth (head forward)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1743888823128064
    m_Localized: Smooth (controller forward)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2131144570343424
    m_Localized: To Vindolanda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2165627214401536
    m_Localized: Sagittarius Sagittarii
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2166963465129984
    m_Localized: Interested in a bit of archery are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2167071204216832
    m_Localized: Grab a bow and show me what you can do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2526931473174528
    m_Localized: Simple enough. Nock, draw, release. You have a quiver on your back
      already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527216518074368
    m_Localized: Archery Practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527392926306304
    m_Localized: Pick up a bow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527756471799808
    m_Localized: Shoot at targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2527913099694080
    m_Localized: Any target is fine. Five arrows. Go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2821858979463168
    m_Localized: 'Not bad, but keep practicing. (score: {vars.score})'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4016942959552888834
  - m_Id: 3186451723620352
    m_Localized: No active quest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4655803421462528
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4666630442618880
    m_Localized: Use the right stick to move to the glowing red marker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4669909268467712
    m_Localized: Repeat instruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4670388643860480
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4671270156537856
    m_Localized: At any time, press the A button on your controllers to repeat the
      last instruction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4670541362663424
    m_Localized: Move to the red marker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4674429352448000
    m_Localized: Grab the item to pick it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4675689417838592
    m_Localized: Hold your palm open, then reach down and physically grab one of
      the bowls in front of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4967076495343616
    m_Localized: Save and Load
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4967997489004544
    m_Localized: Save game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4971702338699264
    m_Localized: Confirm {action}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4016942959552888834
  - m_Id: 4976091384233984
    m_Localized: Load game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4976850175770624
    m_Localized: Quit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4977221392646144
    m_Localized: Start Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5045541152264192
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5046306520469504
    m_Localized: Welcome to Vindolanda. This tutorial will get you used to moving
      in a virtual world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5065700420128768
    m_Localized: You will feel a rumble when the item is ready to grab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5070484665569280
    m_Localized: Virtual reality can be disorienting. Make sure to take things slow
      and take a break if you feel unwell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5072951000207360
    m_Localized: Thank you for completing the tutorial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5073100854300672
    m_Localized: Feel free to explore Vindolanda at your own pace, or see if the
      Romans need help with anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5073812141150208
    m_Localized: If you ever need to revisit this tutorial, you can do so though
      the settings menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5392022472212480
    m_Localized: Good, let's move on to picking up items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6820202500362240
    m_Localized: Save your game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6820510257418240
    m_Localized: Good, now let's move on to using menus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6820602666323968
    m_Localized: Open the menu by pressing the B button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6820818236772352
    m_Localized: Point at the "Save game" button, and pull the trigger twice to confirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6821011191533568
    m_Localized: Close the menu by pressing B
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6828072633667584
    m_Localized: Open Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7893713536978944
    m_Localized: This is the granary where we store a year's worth of, you guessed
      it, grain for the garrison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7895209305477120
    m_Localized: The floors in there are ventilated, which keeps the grain dry and
      stops mould.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7896666838700032
    m_Localized: Titus Aelius
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7896928018010112
    m_Localized: We also have plenty of dogs to catch any rats or other vermin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9767784872710144
    m_Localized: Here are the headquarters, or principia, where many of the senior
      officers do their work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9768574110699520
    m_Localized: All of us gather here daily to receive our orders, and three times
      a year for pay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9768811902570496
    m_Localized: Finally there is a shrine, or sacellum, in the centre dedicated
      to Jupiter, the chief deity of our great empire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9770803551047680
    m_Localized: This grand building is the praetorium, or commanding officer's residence
      which serves as a home for our prefect and his family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9771393161138176
    m_Localized: Don't expect the officers to add anything too fancy - it is property
      of the state, after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9771930149490688
    m_Localized: Still, the prefect is free to redecorate as he and his family see
      fit or to install altars to the gods and genii, or spirits, of the building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10459392995790848
    m_Localized: Here is Milecastle 39, we have one of these every mile along the
      wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10459911101386752
    m_Localized: We also have two turrets between each pair of milecastles, making
      that three structures per mile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10460060166950912
    m_Localized: The wall itself started construction in the year 122, and took six
      years to complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10461935310245888
    m_Localized: So far it's done a good job at keeping the tribes from up north
      from raiding our settlements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10810714219646976
    m_Localized: Last night, one of the Brittunculi mistook me for someone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10811346649387008
    m_Localized: That's ridiculous, we're all different, aren't we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10811540229099520
    m_Localized: YES, WE'RE ALL DIFFERENT!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10811641714479104
    m_Localized: YES, WE'RE ALL INDIVIDUALS!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10811734001750016
    m_Localized: We're all individuals!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10839946597535744
    m_Localized: 'A favorite of many of us: the tavern. Whether it''s food, drink,
      or gambling, or a bed, they''ve got you covered.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10840612854337536
    m_Localized: Just be careful if you gamble, there's no guarantee that your opponent's
      dice won't be loaded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10840819281203200
    m_Localized: As usual, the building is long and thin since taxes are based on
      street frontage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12634583268048896
    m_Localized: Please stay aware of your play area, indicated by a blue grid when
      near a wall, and other people at all times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12639117906264064
    m_Localized: Push the right stick forward to begin teleporting, aim at your target,
      then release it when ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12639379626639360
    m_Localized: If the marker is red, you cannot teleport to the pointed area, try
      somewhere else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15180805912641536
    m_Localized: Maybe later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15180784890789888
    m_Localized: Sure, follow me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15182289207279616
    m_Localized: Okay, I'll follow you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15182454341222400
    m_Localized: I'll be here if you change your mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
